	(text "POWER SUPERVISOR REGULATOR"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.97 13.97 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
				(thickness 0.1905)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e53bd4af-49cf-4e59-9e9e-e5ca32164b7a")
	)
	(text_box "Design Requirements:\n1) Vcc = 3.3V\n2) V_{mon1} = 3.3V -5%\n3) V_{mon2} = 1.8V -5%\n4) V_{mon3} = 1.8V -5%\n5) V_{mon4} = 1.0V +-5%\n6) Start-up time = 300ms\n\nVoltage Rails:\n\nV_{mon1} = (1 + R_{S1H} / R_{S1L}) * 0.4\nR_{S1H} = 68k\nR_{S1L} = 10k\nV_{mon1} = 3.12\n\nV_{mon2} = (1 + R_{S2H} / R_{S2L}) * 0.4\nR_{S2H} = 22k\nR_{S2L} = 6.8k\nV_{mon2} = 1.69\n\nV_{mon3} = (1 + R_{S3H} / R_{S3L}) * 0.4\nR_{S3H} = 22k\nR_{S3L} = 6.8k\nV_{mon3} = 1.69\n\nV_{mon4UV} = (1 + (R_{S4H} / (R_{S4M} + R_{S4L}))) * 0.4\nV_{mon4OV} = (1 + ((R_{S4H} + R_{S4M}) / R_{S4L})) * 0.4\nR_{S4H} = 51k\nR_{S4M} = 6.8k\nR_{S4L} = 33k\nV_{mon4UV} = 0.91\nV_{mon4OV} = 1.10\n\nStart-up time:\n- Pullup CT1-CT4 to VCC w/ 100k resistors forces fixed 300ms\n\nReset Logic:\n- If FPGA voltage rails fail, reset FPGA only\n- If MCU/RF frontend voltage rails fail, reset MCU (which subsequently resets FPGA and RF frontend on boot)\n- If MCU watchdog fails, reset MCU (repeat above)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 231.14 13.97 0)
		(size 52.07 90.17)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
			(color 0 0 194 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 0 0 194 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "33d045ee-e488-4039-a9cd-2b76811f9157")
	)
	(text_box "Separate LDO for supervisor circuit keeps things independent of downstream power rails.\n\nOutput voltage of 1.9V allows clean interface w/ 1.8V MCU and provides margin above the 1.8V supervisor minimum supply."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.97 60.7586 0)
		(size 58.42 14.1714)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
			(color 0 0 194 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 0 0 194 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "35ece9d6-c629-4f1e-9630-7013beb38d7f")
	)
	(text_box "Soft Reset (output active LOW): Resets E1 (which resets FPGA and RF frontend on boot)\n\nHard Reset (output active HIGH): Power cycles regulators, restarts power sequence"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.97 184.15 0)
		(size 59.69 12.1268)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
